<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZCC clears Blue Star to buy General Packaging.</title>
<headline>NZCC clears Blue Star to buy General Packaging.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Commerce Commission said on Wednesday it had cleared Blue Star Group Ltd to buy General Packaging Ltd (GPL).</p>
<p>Blue Star is a unit of U.S. Office Products.</p>
<p>GPL is a supplier of packaging materials, cleaning producs, cafeteria services and commercial stationery in the metropolitan Auckland area.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
